================================================================================
ENTERPRISE PRIVACY & LOCAL ARCHITECTURE STATEMENT
================================================================================
1. Zero Cloud Telemetry: Downex and this extension do NOT transmit any user data,
   URLs, cookies, browsing history, or identifiers to any remote server or cloud.
2. Air-Gapped Local Loopback: All communication between this extension and the
   desktop Downex accelerator is strictly bound to 127.0.0.1 (local machine only).
3. Memory Safety: All media detection uses scoped Shadow-DOM elements and WeakMaps
   to ensure zero memory leaks and zero CSS contamination of host web pages.
